WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,940
Follow Su Lingyue

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:05,820
What do you want to do, cousin?

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:08,060
Not related by blood

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:10,340
I won't take care of him at all. Wen Chen saved me

5
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:11,700
Also my real cousin

6
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,180
My cousin loved me so much before

7
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:14,740
As long as I say forty and not

8
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,060
I didn't want to steal your identity

9
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,620
I really like brother Tingfeng

10
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:18,900
Can you give him back to me?

11
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,940
He doesn't want to appear vicious in front of his cousin, right?

12
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,700
It's a pity that you don't enter the entertainment industry

13
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:23,900
Eye size anytime, anywhere

14
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:29,300
The business award owes you a statuette. You asked the tax department to

15
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:34,440
Check the Su family’s taxes.

16
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,560
Want to tip off

17
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:38,080
The one I sent to my sister doesn’t work either.

18
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,380
I'll contact the tax department right away

19
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:41,940
You don’t understand what I say

20
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,200
I believe someone in the Su family can understand

21
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,960
How could you have so much power?

22
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:47,720
Hard words can't change the facts

23
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,120
Help me tell the Su family

24
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:57,080
Don't let Su Lingyue appear in front of me. They are just as good as the Meng family. I will check myself when I get back. It's not that you don't want to report, it's just that it's not my turn yet.

25
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:58,640
Then help the Su family join the team

26
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,200
Why don't you get out if it doesn't develop as I want?
